.TH LIBMPQ__STRERROR 3 2026-08-12 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__strerror \- return a string describing a libmpq error code.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "const char *libmpq__strerror(int32_t return_code);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Call \fBlibmpq__strerror\fP() to get a message for a libmpq return code.
.SH RETURN VALUE
The function returns a pointer to a read-only string, or NULL if \fIreturn_code\fP is not a libmpq return code.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq (3), strerror (3)
.SH AUTHOR
.TP
The libmpq project was started in 2003.
.B Maik Broemme <mbroemme@libmpq.org>
.PP
